thub.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-13T18:36:38Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\nThis adds syntax highlighting for string placeholders to the script editor, e.g. `%s` and `{placeholder}`.\r\nWith the default editor theme, this looks like the following:\r\n<img width=\"820\" height=\"740\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef261e74-d953-400c-8270-3f3e3f0fa9f6\" />\r\n\r\nAnd the in-editor documentation for `String.format()` looks like this:\r\n<img width=\"1080\" height=\"820\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8c663b7-e365-439d-b16f-e3fe311cbf89\" />\r\n\r\nThe orange color was chosen to be easily distinguishable from the string color, but not too distracting. Placeholders in string names are a bit more difficult to notice, though, but I'm not sure they warrant making the much more frequent string use case worse.\r\n\r\nCloses godotengine/godot-proposals#13600.\r\n\r\nEdit: The implementation is generic to all string-like regions, so highlighting occurs in String, StringName, NodePath, and the `get_node()` short-hands `$\"\"` and `%\"\"`, even for those that do not support percent-style placeholders or the `format()` method; in those situations, a GDScript error should appear anyway.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112575/reactions","total_count":51,"+1":23,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":17,"rocket":0,"eyes":11},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112575/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}